<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to Watch.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to Watch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Gillette Co is expected to report fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.63, compared to $0.52 a year ago, according to First Call. Shares closed at 81-1/8.</p>
<p>* Coca-Cola Co is expected to report fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.31, compared to $0.26 a year ago, according to First Call. Shares closed at 56-3/8.</p>
<p>* Intel Corp, up 1-1/2 at 156-1/2 in London, led high tech shares higher on reports that price cuts on its most powerful computer chips were lower than expected.</p>
<p>Also in London, Compaq Computer Corp was up 3/8 at 85 and Dell Computer Corp rose 1/2 to 66-1/8.</p>
